        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Watcher is a first-person psychological horror game with a short but intense experience, centered on tension, an oppressive atmosphere, and the fear of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young woman waiting for your partner to return home. Night falls, and with it, a disturbing feeling that something—or someone—is watching you from the shadows. Every reflection, every sound, every corner seems to hide an invisible presence... one that refuses to be ignored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to explore a home while surviving a silent stalker. There are no weapons. There is no combat. Only sound, your intuition, and environmental details will be your tools to resist.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person narrative psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on exploration and role-playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements available for the most observant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interface available in English and Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive soundtrack and sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to remain calm when you feel you are no longer alone?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Watcher is a first-person psychological horror game with a short but intense experience, centered on tension, an oppressive atmosphere, and the fear of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young woman waiting for your partner to return home. Night falls, and with it, a disturbing feeling that something—or someone—is watching you from the shadows. Every reflection, every sound, every corner seems to hide an invisible presence... one that refuses to be ignored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to explore a home while surviving a silent stalker. There are no weapons. There is no combat. Only sound, your intuition, and environmental details will be your tools to resist.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person narrative psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on exploration and role-playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements available for the most observant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interface available in English and Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive soundtrack and sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to remain calm when you feel you are no longer alone?</p>",
        "short_description": "You're waiting for your partner at home. But something isn't right. You feel a presence, something watching you... from every window, every shadow. In Silent Watcher, fear isn't what you see—it's what you feel. A psychological horror where the enemy is always there.",
